ritten in my journal recently?\", \"Thanks. Would you tell me how many entries that is?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0006\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what I still need to get done this week, please?\", \"Thank you. And what about next week?\"], [\"left to do this week?\", \"and next week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0007\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's my earliest appointment tomorrow?\", \"ok and, uh, what appointments have I got on friday?\", \"ah actually never mind\"], [\"I want to know how early I need to set my alarm, so what's the first appointment I've got tomorrow?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to figure out if I can squeeze in a haircut, so what appointments do I have on friday?\", \"Oh actually, forget it, I've just remembered the salon's shut that day anyway, so never mind.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0008\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when my quilting thing is, please?\", \"Separately, would you count how many pictures I have from Losness?\", \"Could you please add a task to sort out the korfball?\", \"Would you mind looking up Tariq Cheetham for me?\", \"Thank you. Could you give me their contact details, please?\"], [\"when's quilting?\", \"count Losness pics\", \"task: sort out the korfball\", \"Tariq Cheetham\", \"their contact details?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0009\", \"v\": [[\"umm what quilting stuff have I got?\", \"ok can you delete the, uh, the fourth one\", \"different thing — can you show me my pictures from Porvoo Island?\", \"hmm, just the ones from this month actually\"], [\"quilting stuff?\", \"delete the fourth one\", \"Porvoo Island pics\", \"only this month\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0010\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you message Cecily the club app?\", \"ok, uh, are there any portal entries in my locker?\", \"what's the password for the, um, the first one?\", \"different thing — what've I got about porcupine?\"], [\"Cecily keeps asking me where to download it, so could you message Cecily the club app for me?\", \"Okay, different thing, I'm paying some bills tonight and can't remember what's saved — do I have any portal entries in my locker?\", \"Great, I need to log into the first one to check my bill, so could you give me its password?\", \"Totally unrelated, my kid's doing a school project on animals and I swear I saved something — what do I have about porcupine?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0011\", \"v\": [[\"can u bump the grapefruit viewing two hours later pls\", \"also open the Quilting club highlights album thx\"], [\"umm can you bump the grapefruit viewing… like two hours later?\", \"ok and, uh, can you open the Quilting club highlights album for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0012\", \"v\": [[\"My neighbour's asking when I'm borrowing his trailer and I can't remember what I set up, so could you pull up my calendar entries about tractor?\"], [\"tractor entries?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0013\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which appointments I have on thursday, please?\", \"On a different note, would you please delete every Chatsworth photo I have?\", \"Oh no, I didn't mean that — could you bring them back, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me where the Kanna one was taken?\"], [\"thursday appointments?\", \"delete every Chatsworth photo\", \"undo, bring them back\", \"where was the Kanna one taken?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0014\", \"v\": [[\"umm I phoned Flovie today, can you log that?\", \"oh, uh, Bruckner, the Bruckner one\", \"ok different thing — who's in the, um, the blacksmithing class shot?\", \"oh and I phoned the Flergewyn one, can you log that too?\", \"right, new thing… who am I having dinner with on friday?\"], [\"Could you please log that I phoned Flovie today?\", \"Sorry, it was Bruckner.\", \"On another topic, could you tell me which people are in the blacksmithing class shot?\", \"I also phoned the Flergewyn one — would you log that as well, please?\", \"Lastly, could you tell me who I'm having dinner with on friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w37-0015\", \"v\": [[\"i phoned Flovie Bruckner today can u log it pls\"], [\"I finally cau